  "bio": "At Lifestyle Tattoo Co, immerse yourself in an artistic haven where neotraditional designs blend seamlessly with whimsical watercolors and expressive lettering. Nestled in the heart of Meridian, our studios at 5455 N. Glenwood St., Garden City, and 2020 E. Overland Rd., Suite 120, provide a sanctuary for creativity where every inked masterpiece reflects your unique journey. Join us for a tattoo experience that's as individual as you are.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Meridian, Idaho, United States"
